{
 "_about": "One record per claim of the community section: a source (records/community/sources.json), where in it the claim is shown (`at`: the second in the video; `reply`: the id of the creator's comment under the video, whose pictures or text carry the claim), the character it is about and the value in the source's own terms. `tier`: the tier on the source's list. `team`: one row of the source's team chart for a main damage dealer (`subject`): the second teammate and the third, any one of those listed; `label` is the source's own mark of the row (主推, 備選); `member_kibo`: the Kibo the source gives each member, main first, any one of those listed. `damage`: a whole team (`team`, main first), the Kibo each member carries (`kibo`, same order; empty where the source names none), the rotation in seconds, the total damage and the damage per second, as the source writes them. `lingzi`: the main's 靈子 compared: the 靈子, its 階 (滿 where the source writes 滿階), the damage against the source's base (`ratio`, 100% for the base), and where the source gives them the team (`team`) and its DPS. `kibo`: a Kibo the source names for the main beyond the one in its team row (`note`: when). Read from the charts on screen and the creator's comments. `facility`: a home facility (records/housing.json) on the source's build-order chart: its group on the chart, the tier, and the chart's own advice beside it (`note`). `job`: the Kibo the source recommends for one work, early and late; `evolutions`: those the source marks 及其进化体 (and its evolved forms). `advice`: one piece of the source's advice about a facility (`facility`) or another part of the home (`topic`), restated.",
