  },
  {
   "source": "chunfengmanma-2026-11-26-home",
   "kind": "advice",
   "facility": "gongmingshitai",
   "text": "定期到家園商店兌換做未開封的記憶要用的追憶的思緒，等能做出金色品質時再大量使用",
   "at": 703
  },
  {
   "source": "chunfengmanma-2026-11-26-home",
   "kind": "advice",
   "facility": "nongchang",
   "text": "天賦詞條選成熟時間減少，遠優於效率評分",
   "reply": 325160025184
  },
  {
   "source": "chunfengmanma-2026-11-26-home",
   "kind": "advice",
   "facility": "nongchang",
